<Prose eyebrow="About" title="About Allyfolio" description="Why we are building Allyfolio: honest, evidence-based accessibility monitoring for EU SMEs and web agencies.">
  <p>Allyfolio is a small, independent side project built for European SMEs and web agencies facing the European Accessibility Act (EAA) and Germany's BFSG.</p>
  <h2>What we believe</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Fix the code, not the symptoms.</strong> We will never sell an overlay widget.</li>
    <li><strong>Be honest about automation.</strong> Automated testing finds roughly 57% of issues (<a href="https://www.deque.com/automated-accessibility-testing-coverage/">Deque study</a>). People still need to review the rest.</li>
    <li><strong>Evidence over promises.</strong> A dated record of real work is worth more than a badge.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions or feedback? Email <a href="mailto:hello@allyfolio.com">hello@allyfolio.com</a>.</p>
